==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Pikachu|66}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Tail Smack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Snivy|13}} one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

